Subject: [PATCH 13/18] col_zk: close the frontier through `msgAt_eq` and
 `edgeIdxOfMsg_eq` (E7)

`col_zk hC := colZK_zk_of_eqs msgAt_eq edgeIdxOfMsg_eq hC`, now that #210 publishes
both equations (explicit binders, definition-argument order). The docstring of
`colZK_planted_eq` is synced (policy section 3). No statement changes.

